<title>USA: Optical Coating merger is called off.</title>
<headline>Optical Coating merger is called off.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA ROSA, Calif. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Coating Laboratory Inc said on Monday its plan to purchase and merge with Optical Corp of America was called off by the board of Optical Corp.</p>
<p>Optical Corp did not provide any reasons for its decision, according to Optical Coating, which said it was considering its options.  </p>
<p>Optical Coating, a leading manufacturer of optical thin film coated components, said it remains committed to participating in the expanding market for fiber optic components used in communications applications.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
